| `SWH_TOKEN` | code | Software Heritage: 1,200 req/h instead of 120 (observed: 10/min anonymous) | Free, account | https://archive.softwareheritage.org/ -> login, profile -> "API token" tab (**not verifiable**: the site returns "Access Denied" (Anubis) to robots; doc `docs.softwareheritage.org` likewise) | Immediate | env `SWH_TOKEN` or `~/.config/vp/swh_token.key` -- declared, no effect until wired |
| `PISTE_CLIENT_ID` + `PISTE_CLIENT_SECRET` | law | Judilibre (French Court of Cassation); later the Legifrance API; without token: 0 requests, `not_configured`; engine **not wired** | Free, nominative PISTE registration (OAuth client credentials, token approx. 1 h) | https://piste.gouv.fr/ (**not verifiable**: 503 on 2026-10-26, already noted in `plugins/law.md`) | Account immediate; subscription per API, review possible | env `PISTE_CLIENT_ID` / `PISTE_CLIENT_SECRET` or `~/.config/vp/piste_client_id.key` / `piste_client_secret.key` |
